{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01YTRUCrvenqPpo1XjV79Ugu","type":"tool_result","content":"2:# hub.sh — interactive front door to almanac loops (ralph, harden)\n20:#   almanac hub --new <ralph|harden|converge> [config…] [--dry-run]\n40:  printf '%s\\n' \"  almanac hub --new <ralph|harden|converge> [config…] [--dry-run]\"\n87:# config logic lives here — one launcher, one UX, shared with `almanac ralph`\n88:# and `almanac harden`. On confirm the launcher execs (hands over the terminal);\n92:  type=\"$(almanac_loop_ui_choose \"New run — pick a loop\" ralph harden converge)\" || return 0\n158:# ralph; target/lenses/provider/model/effort/rounds for harden); ralph's mode is\n184:    ralph)\n193:    harden)\n201:    converge)\n219:  # resume auto-confirms launcher-backed runs via --yes; harden + converge argv\n220:  # is already the direct runner (`almanac harden|converge …`) and rejects the\n223:  if [ \"$mode\" = \"resume\" ] && [ \"$run_type\" != \"harden\" ] && [ \"$run_type\" != \"converge\" ]; then\n244:      [ \"$#\" -gt 0 ] || _die \"Missing run type for --new (ralph|harden|converge)\"\n355:      1) _die \"Unknown run type: $ACTION_TYPE (use ralph or harden)\" ;;\n356:      2) _die \"Missing required config for $ACTION_TYPE (ralph needs --prd, harden needs --target)\" ;;","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01SuYErvjfYyTJk6MumfHidS","session_id":"a891a69f-75d4-4053-b662-17c3d63f7902","uuid":"1f0a5619-c3e4-4d71-8691-e97c0c0dd0b8","timestamp":"2026-05-26T14:37:31.286Z","subagent_type":"Explore","task_description":"Explore for deepening opportunities"}
