ld I style this stream right now\". `almanac_report_gum` prints the verdict with an install hint, and both the claude-code and codex installers call it at the end of `almanac install`, so install **and** doctor surface gum's presence/absence. Every optional dep is exactly that — absent, the CLI degrades to plain output, keeping almanac's near-zero-dependency promise.","numLines":4,"startLine":52,"totalLines":111}}}
